import_legacy.description:
Cable Juice Planner PyScript installations found in the config folder:
{files}

Choose which one to import from (it may have another prefix than **{prefix}**). The settings are used as defaults on the next pages, the databases (charging history, drive efficiency, consumption, prices, solar) are copied at the first start, and the values of the old input_* helpers are copied to the new entities. The PyScript files are only read, never changed.
